# 🚀 Annotated Transformers – Full Training Pipeline

![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/Status-Active-brightgreen)
![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.10+-blue)
![PyTorch](https://img.shields.io/badge/PyTorch-Transformer-orange)
![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-lightgrey)

A complete, production‑ready Transformer training system inspired by **Annotated Transformer**, featuring:

- Automatic checkpoint saving
- Automatic resume from latest epoch
- Clean configuration file
- Greedy decoding + BLEU scoring
- Random evaluation samples
- Multi30k German→English dataset

---

## 📦 Features

- Custom Transformer (Encoder + Decoder)
- spaCy tokenization (German + English)
- Vocabulary building
- Training with checkpointing
- Auto‑resume from latest checkpoint
- Evaluation with BLEU score
- Cleaned inference output (removes `<unk>`)

---

## 📁 Project Structure

```
Annotated Transformers/
│
├── config.py
├── train_main.py
├── evaluate.py
│
├── model/
│   ├── transformer.py
│   ├── train.py
│   └── utils.py
│
├── pipeline/
│   ├── vocab.py
│   ├── dataloader.py
│   ├── dataset.py
│   └── tokenize.py
│
└── multi30k_model_epoch_X.pt
```

---

## ⚙️ Configuration (`config.py`)

```python
config = {
    "batch_size": 32,
    "distributed": False,
    "num_epochs": 20,
    "accum_iter": 10,
    "base_lr": 1.0,
    "max_padding": 72,
    "warmup": 3000,
    "file_prefix": "multi30k_model_",
    "save_every_epoch": True
}
```

---

## 🏋️ Training (`train_main.py`)

Automatically:

- Loads vocab + spaCy models
- Builds Transformer
- Detects latest checkpoint
- Resumes training or starts fresh

### Run training

```
caffeinate -d python train_main.py
```

---

## 🔁 Checkpointing

After every epoch, a checkpoint is saved:

```
multi30k_model_epoch_1.pt
multi30k_model_epoch_2.pt
...
multi30k_model_final.pt
```

The system automatically resumes from the **highest epoch**.

---

## 📊 Evaluation (`evaluate.py`)

Shows:

- Input (German)
- Ground truth (English)
- Model output (raw)
- Model output (cleaned)
- BLEU score for the example

### Run evaluation

```
caffeinate -d python evaluate.py
```

---

## 📈 BLEU Scoring

Install:

```
pip install sacrebleu
```

---

## 🧠 Inference

Greedy decoding:

- Predicts next token using argmax
- Stops at EOS
- Removes `<unk>` tokens

Example output:

```
<s> A child in a green shirt is holding a </s>
```

---

